>\n<li>Added <code>--exclude-files</code> option to the WP-CLI backup command</li>\n<li>Updated the bundled phpseclib library to patch a security vulnerability (CVE-2026-55599)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>1.39</h4>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Update the bundled phpseclib library to patch security vulnerabilities (CVE-2026-44167, CVE-2026-40194)</li>\n<li>Fixed stored XSS vulnerability in the backups path setting</li>\n<li>Improved PHP 8.5 compatibility</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>1.38</h4>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed Mega login issue caused by hashcash challenge returning 402 Payment Required</li>\n<li>Added permission checks for <code>admin_post</code> actions to improve security</li>\n<li>Fixed broken User Guide links in the admin interface</li>\n<li>Improved PHP 8 compatibility in the export/import pipeline</li>\n<li>Improved compatibility with other plugins by isolating vendor dependencies</li>\n</ul>\";}s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:127:\"https://d1zsuv05404qm1.cloudfront.net/05c43e34-a515-4bb0-a039-2e20aa9b446a/img/products/all-in-one-wp-migration-pro-772x250.png\";s:4:\"high\";s:128:\"https://d1zsuv05404qm1.cloudfront.net/05c43e34-a515-4bb0-a039-2e20aa9b446a/img/products/all-in-one-wp-migration-pro-1544x500.png\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:3:{s:2:\"1x\";s:127:\"https://d1zsuv05404qm1.cloudfront.net/05c43e34-a515-4bb0-a039-2e20aa9b446a/img/products/all-in-one-wp-migration-pro-128x128.png\";s:2:\"2x\";s:127:\"https://d1zsuv05404qm1.cloudfront.net/05c43e34-a515-4bb0-a039-2e20aa9b446a/img/products/all-in-one-wp-migration-pro-256x256.png\";s:7:\"default\";s:127:\"https://d1zsuv05404qm1.cloudfront.net/05c43e34-a515-4bb0-a039-2e20aa9b446a/img/products/all-in-one-wp-migration-pro-256x256.png\";}s:6:\"rating\";i:99;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:509;s:10:\"downloaded\";i:50188;}}','yes'),(11534,'maxbuttons_version','9.8.6','yes'),(11535,'MBFREE_CREATED','1690802005','yes'),(11536,'MBFREE_HOMEURL','https://homemadecircus.yme.so','yes'),(11539,'maxbuttons_user_level','manage_options','yes'),(12760,'category_children','a:0:{