w=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(118,24,'_video','field_649f271ce6802'),(119,24,'large_word_two','Playful'),(120,24,'_large_word_two','field_649f2731e6804'),(121,24,'large_word_three','Joyful'),(122,24,'_large_word_three','field_649f2743e6805'),(123,24,'about','<h2>Created by Upswing, the Homemade Circus toolkit will equip you with the skills and confidence to lead your own inspiring circus activity sessions.</h2>\r\n<strong>In the decade that we have been bringing circus into care homes, we have seen some extraordinary results. </strong>Our activities have helped spark new friendships, brought shy residents out of their shell, seen dexterity and flexibility return, and helped care staff and residents to see each other in a whole new light.\r\n<h3>What\'s included:</h3>\r\nInside you’ll find instructional videos, activity worksheets, expert guidance and practical insights to take your sessions further.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re seeking gentle introductions or a challenge, our circus artists will guide you step-by-step on how to properly use different circus equipment and share the joy of circus with the people in your care home.\r\n\r\nEven a complete beginner can learn to structure their first unforgettable circus session that is tailored to the people they work with.\r\n\r\n<strong>If you\'re ready to try something new in your care home, click the \'join now\' button below.</strong>\r\n\r\n[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]<!-- notionvc: 0e9510f7-1aa4-4e54-a132-e4c1b4a23a77 -->'),(124,24,'_about','field_649f272ce6803'),(125,24,'pricing','<strong>Choose from 3 flexible membership options</strong>\r\n\r\nEveryone deserves access to valuable resources and support, regardless of their background or budget.\r\n\r\nWe offer 3 membership options on a sliding scale so that you can find an accessible option for you. No matter which membership you choose, you\'ll get the same content as everyone else.\r\n\r\n<strong>(Our donation-based memberships help subsidise the free &amp; discounted options, ensuring accessible resources for all!)</strong>\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re an NHS worker, care home staff, individual, freelancer, or part of a larger organisation, click \'Join Now\' to choose your membership\r\n<h2>[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]</h2>\r\n<!-- notionvc: eebb0b45-36a7-4a97-9cc0-fd8424d9e050 -->'),(126,24,'_pricing','field_649f277ae6806'),(127,24,'testimonials','3'),(128,24,'_testimonials','field_649f2791e6807'),(129,24,'contact','To find out more about Homemade Circus or to contact for any other reason please email us at\r\n\r\n<a href=\"mailto:info@upswing.org.uk\">info@upswing.org.uk</a>'),(130,24,'_contact','field_649f27c9e680a'),(131,24,'final_image','193'),(132,24,'_final_image','field_649f27d4e680b'),(159,41,'_edit_last','3'),(160,41,'_mepr_rules_type','all_activity'),(161,41,'_mepr_rules_content','411'),(162,41,'_is_mepr_rules_content_regexp',''),(163,41,'_mepr_rules_drip_enabled',''),(164,41,'_mepr_rules_drip_amount','0'),(165,41,'_mepr_rules_drip_unit','days'),(166,41,'_mepr_rules_drip_after_fixed',''),(167,41,'_mepr_rules_drip_after','registers'),(168,41,'_mepr_rules_expires_enabled',''),(169,41,'_mepr_rules_expires_amount','0'),(170,41,'_mepr_rules_expires_unit','days'),(171,41,'_mepr_rules_expires_after','registers'),(172,41,'_mepr_rules_expires_after_fixed',''),(173,41,'_mepr_rules_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(174,41,'_mepr_rules_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(175,41,'_mepr_rules_unauth_message_type','default'),(176,41,'_mepr_rules_unath_message',''),(177,41,'_mepr_rules_unath_login','default'),(178,41,'_mepr_auto_gen_title','1'),(179,41,'_edit_lock','1727096506:3'),(180,42,'_edit_lock','1716238426:3'),(181,42,'_edit_last','3'),(182,42,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(183,42,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(184,42,'_mepr_unauth_login','show'),(185,42,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(186,42,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(187,44,'_edit_lock','1715263188:3'),(188,44,'_edit_last','3'),(189,44,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(190,44,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(191,44,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(192,44,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(193,44,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(208,50,'_edit_last','1'),(209,50,'_edit_lock','1689439788:1'),(213,54,'_edit_lock','1775731785:3'),(214,54,'_edit_last','3'),(215,54,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(216,54,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(217,54,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(218,54,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(219,54,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(220,56,'_edit_lock','1716236613:3'),(221,56,'_edit_last','3'),(222,56,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(223,56,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(224,56,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(225,56,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(226,56,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(232,24,'about_opening_paragraph',''),(233,24,'_about_opening_paragraph','field_649f28c8681cc'),(256,24,'testimonials_0_testimonial','I used to think the circus was a clown with a big red nose, but it\'s not that. it\'s fun, it\'s\r\nexercise, it\'s music, it\'s singing together, it\'s bonding together. It\'s like holding hands, and\r\nforming a group dance. It\'s bringing all the people together and that\'s good for their\r\nwellbeing… They smile, they talk about this for the next few days and take the positive\r\nimpact with them…'),(257,24,'_testimonials_0_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(258,24,'testimonials_0_name','Care Home Staff'),(259,24,'_testimonials_0_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(260,24,'testimonials_1_testimonial','These activities are just so much fun. I always say to people - I can do a 12 hour shift on those days because it just takes me somewhere else…It gives you that excitement... you have so much extra oxygen! So, so much creativity.'),(261,24,'_testimonials_1_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(262,24,'testimonials_1_name','Care Home Staff'),(263,24,'_testimonials_1_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(264,24,'testimonials_2_testimonial','The first session was just magical. It really stuck in my head… I never thought that I could\r\ndo so many things with a ball or a hat or a simple scarf. It\'s like now when we get bored, you\r\ncan take anything and you can just dance around, make some fun things with it. I never\r\nthought I could create something out of nothing, really.'),(265,24,'_testimonials_2_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(266,24,'testimonials_2_name','Care Home Staff'),(267,24,'_testimonials_2_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(302,62,'_edit_lock','1787227378:3'),(303,62,'_edit_last','3'),(304,62,'download','1'),(305,62,'_download','field_64c2860925422'),(306,62,'side_info','1'),(307,62,'_side_info','field_649f23a3df204'),(308,62,'tags','a:6:{i:0;s:2:\"15\";i:1;s:2:\"14\";i:2;s:2:\"12\";i:3;s:2:\"16\";i:4;s:2:\"11\";i:5;s:2:\"13\";}'),(309,62,'_tags','field_649f258acef67'),(310,62,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(311,62,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(312,62,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(313,62,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(314,62,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(315,63,'_edit_lock','1787229438:3'),(316,63,'_edit_last','3'),(317,63,'download','1'),(318,63,'_download','field_64c2860925422'),(319,63,'side_info','1'),(320,63,'_side_info','field_649f23a3df204'),(321,63,'tags','a:2:{i:0;s:1:\"3\";i:1;s:1:\"4\";}'),(322,63,'_tags','field_649f258acef67'),(323,63,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(324,63,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(325,63,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(326,63,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(327,63,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(328,64,'_edit_lock','1787229398:3'),(329,64,'_edit_last','3'),(330,64,'download','1'),(331,64,'_download','field_64c2860925422'),(332,64,'side_info','1'),(333,64,'_side_info','field_649f2