y\" style=\"width: 600px;background: white;padding: 40px;margin: 0 auto;text-align: left\">\n<div id=\"receipt\">\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px\">Thank you for your donation. We can\'t wait for you to start learning our circus activities for care settings. But first things first, here\'s a reminder of how to login to your account:</div>\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px\">You can login here: <a href=\"http://homemade-circus.local/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">homemadecircus.co.uk/login</a></div>\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px\">Using the username and password you signed up with (a reminder of that below). Be sure to keep this email for future reference.</div>\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px\">\n<table class=\"transaction\" style=\"clear: both\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left\">Username:</th>\n<td>{$username}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left\">Password:</th>\n<td>*** Password you set during signup ***</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px\">Once you\'re logged in you\'ll head straight to a welcome page that will give you a little more info on how to use the toolkit. Any questions just let us know,</div>\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px\">Cheers!</div>\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px\">The {$blog_name} Team</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\";}}'),(961,124,'_mepr_disable_address_fields',''),(962,124,'_mepr_allow_simultaneous_subscriptions','1'),(963,124,'_mepr_use_custom_template',''),(964,124,'_mepr_custom_template','page-templates/page-template.php'),(965,124,'_mepr_customize_payment_methods','1'),(966,124,'_mepr_customize_profile_fields','1'),(967,124,'_mepr_cannot_purchase_message','You don\'t have access to purchase this item.'),(968,124,'_mepr_plan_code',''),(969,124,'_wp_page_template',''),(970,124,'_mepruserroles_enabled',''),(971,124,'_mepr