scarf with an elderly white woman who lives in the care home'),(2433,62,'_thumbnail_id','254'),(2434,248,'_wp_attachment_image_alt','A white female care member laughs while holding out juggling balls to someone. words read: \'juggling balls\''),(2435,18,'_thumbnail_id','248'),(2439,306,'_edit_lock','1787652006:1'),(2440,306,'_edit_last','3'),(2441,306,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(2442,306,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(2443,306,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(2444,306,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(2445,306,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(2448,310,'_edit_lock','1716237194:3'),(2449,310,'_edit_last','3'),(2450,310,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(2451,310,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(2452,310,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(2453,310,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(2454,310,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(2456,314,'_edit_lock','1787234675:3'),(2457,314,'_edit_last','3'),(2458,314,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(2459,314,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(2460,314,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(2461,314,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(2462,314,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(2463,316,'footnotes',''),(2464,317,'_edit_lock','1787229974:3'),(2465,317,'_edit_last','3'),(2466,317,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(2467,317,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(2468,317,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(2469,317,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(2470,317,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(2471,319,'footnotes',''),(2472,320,'_menu_item_type','post_type'),(2473,320,'_menu_item_menu_item_parent','0'),(2474,320,'_menu_item_object_id','258'),(2475,320,'_menu_item_object','page'),(2476,320,'_menu_item_target',''),(2477,320,'_menu_item_classes','a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(2478,320,'_menu_item_xfn',''),(2479,320,'_menu_item_url',''),(2481,233,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2483,24,'large_word_one_caption','Whether you\'re a carer or an activity coordinator, make your care home come alive with joy, connection and endless possibilities...'),(2484,24,'_large_word_one_caption','field_6582eaead6654'),(2485,24,'large_word_two_caption','The Homemade Circus Digital Toolkit gives you complete confidence to lead circus activities in your care home environment.'),(2486,24,'_large_word_two_caption','field_6582eaf9d6655'),(2487,24,'large_word_three_caption','We\'ve spent 10+ years testing and evaluating these activities. Now we\'re sharing our tried-and-tested toolkit with you.'),(2488,24,'_large_word_three_caption','field_6582eb08d6656'),(2789,127,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2790,126,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2791,230,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2792,128,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2793,140,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2796,238,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2797,125,'_wp_old_date','2023-10-04'),(2798,336,'_edit_lock','1703184616:1'),(2799,336,'_edit_last','1'),(2800,44,'faq_0_question','What is Homemade Circus?'),(2801,44,'_faq_0_question','field_658489486da97'),(2802,44,'faq_0_answer','Homemade Circus is a two-year project by Upswing that brings the joy and wonder of circus activities to care homes across London and the Southeast. In partnership with care home staff and activity coordinators from Anchor, Excelcare, and BUPA, and funded by City Bridge Trust and The Rayne Foundation, we delivered practical circus sessions for residents and trained care home staff to continue leading these activities independently.\r\n\r\nThe Digital Toolkit website is an online resource providing accessible guides for care home staff to learn to run circus activities within their own settings.'),(2803,44,'_faq_0_answer','field_658489586da98'),(2804,44,'faq_1_question','How can I lead circus activities without any experience?'),(2805,44,'_faq_1_question','field_658489486da97'),(2806,44,'faq_1_answer','<p class=\"Body\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;\">Upswing’s Toolkit will show you step-by-step how you to use Circus equipment (such as juggling balls, coloured scarves and hats), and adapt the sessions to anyone\'s needs, to help improve dexterity, mobility, concentration and to lift the mood of your home. The toolkit is made with complete beginners in mind! We will guide you from start to finish through our instructional videos, downloadable worksheets, equipment links and \'Help\' section.</span></p>'),(2807,44,'_faq_1_answer','field_658489586da98'),(2808,44,'faq_2_question','How can we fit these into a busy schedule?'),(2809,44,'_faq_2_question','field_658489486da97'),(2810,44,'faq_2_answer','<p class=\"Body\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;\">All of the activities in the toolkit can be adapted to suit the needs of your care home, and you can watch the videos at your own pace. Some of these activities can be delivered in just 5 - 10 on a one-to-one basis. We\'ve learnt that even these short sessions encourage connection between staff and residents, and bring benefits to your staff and the people who live in your home. You could also consider scheduling a regular weekly session at the same time each week so that people know when the session is happening.</span></p>'),(2811,44,'_faq_2_answer','field_658489586da98'),(2812,44,'faq','7'),(2813,44,'_faq','field_658489286da96'),(2828,140,'_wp_old_date','2023-12-21'),(2831,238,'_wp_old_date','2023-12-21'),(2832,125,'_wp_old_date','2023-12-21'),(2847,343,'_menu_item_type','post_type'),(2848,343,'_menu_item_menu_item_parent','0'),(2849,343,'_menu_item_object_id','317'),(2850,343,'_menu_item_object','page'),(2851,343,'_menu_item_target',''),(2852,343,'_menu_item_classes','a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(2853,343,'_menu_item_xfn',''),(2854,343,'_menu_item_url',''),(2856,344,'_menu_item_type','post_type'),(2857,344,'_menu_item_menu_item_parent','0'),(2858,344,'_menu_item_object_id','314'),(2859,344,'_menu_item_object','page'),(2860,344,'_menu_item_target',''),(2861,344,'_menu_item_classes','a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(