rkshop with bunting! Watch our video to get your circus workshop off to a great start.'),(4038,411,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','53'),(4039,411,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(4040,411,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','1'),(4041,411,'_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp',''),(4042,408,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Blocks'),(4043,408,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Enhance dexterity, coordination, and strength with lightweight, colorful circus blocks. Join us in exploring different exercises and games in our video to unlock the full potential of these engaging tools.'),(4044,408,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','71'),(4045,408,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(4046,408,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','2'),(4047,408,'_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp',''),(4048,413,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','beach balls'),(4049,413,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Enhance engagement and connections in your workshop by using beach balls to get participants involved. Improve focus and coordination with this fun activity!'),(4050,413,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','73'),(4051,413,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(4052,413,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','2'),(4053,413,'_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp',''),(4054,415,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Ribbons'),(4055,415,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Discover the joy of creating colorful shapes and movements with ribbons! Perfect for groups or partners, our video demonstrates various movements and games to incorporate into your workshop.'),(4056,415,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','73'),(4057,415,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(4058,415,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','1'),(4059,415,'_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp',''),(4060,417,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','parachute'),(4061,417,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Experience the power of collaboration and connection through our parachute activities. This circus workshop offer a gentle and calming way to end your session.'),(4062,417,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','60'),(4063,417,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(4064,4