em_target',''),(5019,532,'_menu_item_classes','a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(5020,532,'_menu_item_xfn',''),(5021,532,'_menu_item_url',''),(5023,320,'_wp_old_date','2024-03-19'),(5024,233,'_wp_old_date','2024-03-19'),(5025,535,'_edit_lock','1716218842:1'),(5026,535,'_edit_last','1'),(5027,535,'_mepr_unauthorized_message_type','default'),(5028,535,'_mepr_unauthorized_message',''),(5029,535,'_mepr_unauth_login','default'),(5030,535,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_type','default'),(5031,535,'_mepr_unauth_excerpt_size','100'),(5032,535,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(5033,535,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','1'),(5034,535,'_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp',''),(5035,537,'_menu_item_type','post_type'),(5036,537,'_menu_item_menu_item_parent','0'),(5037,537,'_menu_item_object_id','535'),(5038,537,'_menu_item_object','page'),(5039,537,'_menu_item_target',''),(5040,537,'_menu_item_classes','a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(5041,537,'_menu_item_xfn',''),(5042,537,'_menu_item_url',''),(5044,176,'_wp_old_date','2023-08-04'),(5045,180,'_wp_old_date','2023-08-04'),(5383,546,'large_word_one','Connection'),(5384,546,'_large_word_one','field_649f26a3e6800'),(5385,546,'slideshow','a:5:{i:0;s:3:\"187\";i:1;s:3:\"189\";i:2;s:3:\"193\";i:3;s:3:\"195\";i:4;s:3:\"191\";}'),(5386,546,'_slideshow','field_649f270ce6801'),(5387,546,'video','<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q65pOMSbvV8?si=e0i50hbJAgg03E9d\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(5388,546,'_video','field_649f271ce6802'),(5389,546,'large_word_two','Playful'),(5390,546,'_large_word_two','field_649f2731e6804'),(5391,546,'large_word_three','Joyful'),(5392,546,'_large_word_three','field_649f2743e6805'),(5393,546,'about','<h2>Created by Upswing, the Homemade Circus toolkit will equip you with the skills and confidence to lead your own inspiring circus activity sessions.</h2>\r\nIn the decade that we have been bringing circus into care homes, we have seen some extraordinary results. Our activities have helped spark new friendships, brought shy residents out of their shell, seen dexterity and flexibility return, and helped care staff and residents to see each other in a whole new light.\r\n<h2>Inside you’ll find:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Training videos</li>\r\n 	<li>Activity worksheets</li>\r\n 	<li>Expert guidance and practical insights to take your sessions further</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWhether you’re seeking gentle introductions or a challenge, our circus artists will guide you step-by-step on how to properly use different circus equipment and share the joy of circus with the people in your care home.\r\n\r\nEven a complete beginner can learn how to structure their first unforgettable circus session that is tailored to the people they work with.\r\n\r\n<strong>If you\'re ready to try something new in your care home, click the \'join now\' button below.</strong>\r\n\r\n[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]'),(5394,546,'_about','field_649f272ce6803'),(5395,546,'pricing','<h2>Choose from 3 flexible membership options</h2>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">Everyone deserves access to valuable resources and support, regardless of their background or budget.</p>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">We offer 3 membership options on a sliding scale so that you can find an accessible option for you. No matter which membership you choose, you\'ll get the same content as everyone else.</p>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>(Our donation-based memberships help subsidise the free &amp; discounted options, ensuring accessible resources for all!)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">Whether you\'re an NHS worker, care home staff, individual, freelancer, or part of a larger organisation, click \'Join Now\' to choose your membership</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]</span></h2>\r\n&nbsp;'),(5396,546,'_pricing','field_649f277ae6806'),(5397,546,'testimonials','3'),(5398,546,'_testimonials','field_649f2791e6807'),(5399,546,'contact','To find out more about Homemade Circus or to contact for any other reason please email us at\r\n\r\n<a href=\"mailto:info@upswing.org.uk\">info@upswing.org.uk</a>'),(5400,546,'_contact','field_649f27c9e680a'),(5401,546,'final_image','193'),(5402,546,'_final_image','field_649f27d4e680b'),(5403,546,'about_opening_paragraph',''),(5404,546,'_about_opening_paragraph','field_649f28c8681cc'),(5405,546,'testimonials_0_testimonial','I used to think the circus was a clown with a big red nose, but it\'s not that. it\'s fun, it\'s\r\nexercise, it\'s music, it\'s singing together, it\'s bonding together. It\'s like holding hands, and\r\nforming a group dance. It\'s bringing all the people together and that\'s good for their\r\nwellbeing… They smile, they talk about this for the next few days and take the positive\r\nimpact with them…'),(5406,546,'_testimonials_0_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5407,546,'testimonials_0_name','Care Home Staff'),(5408,546,'_testimonials_0_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5409,546,'testimonials_1_testimonial','These activities are just so much fun. I always say to people - I can do a 12 hour shift on those days because it just takes me somewhere else…It gives you that excitement... you have so much extra oxygen! So, so much creativity.'),(5410,546,'_testimonials_1_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5411,546,'testimonials_1_name','Care Home Staff'),(5412,546,'_testimonials_1_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5413,546,'testimonials_2_testimonial','The first session was just magical. It really stuck in my head… I never thought that I could\r\ndo so many things with a ball or a hat or a simple scarf. It\'s like now when we get bored, you\r\ncan take anything and you can just dance around, make some fun things with it. I never\r\nthought I could create something out of nothing, really.'),(5414,546,'_testimonials_2_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5415,546,'testimonials_2_name','Care Home Staff'),(5416,546,'_testimonials_2_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5417,546,'temp_image','224'),(5418,546,'_temp_image','field_64c784060f370'),(5419,546,'large_word_one_caption','Whether you\'re a carer or an activity coordinator, make your care home come alive with joy, connection and endless possibilities...'),(5420,546,'_large_word_one_caption','field_6582eaead6654'),(5421,546,'large_word_two_caption','The Homemade Circus Digital Toolkit gives you complete confidence to lead circus activities in your care home environment.'),(5422,546,'_large_word_two_caption','field_6582eaf9d6655'),(5423,546,'large_word_three_caption','We\'ve spent 10+ years testing and evaluating these activities. Now we\'re sharing our tried-and-tested toolkit with you.'),(5424,546,'_large_word_three_caption','field_6582eb08d6656'),(5425,547,'large_word_one','Connection'),(5426,547,'_large_word_one','field_649f26a3e6800'),(5427,547,'slideshow','a:5:{i:0;s:3:\"187\";i:1;s:3:\"189\";i:2;s:3:\"193\";i:3;s:3:\"195\";i:4;s:3:\"191\";}'),(5428,547,'_slideshow','field_649f270ce6801'),(5429,547,'video','<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q65pOMSbvV8?si=e0i50hbJAgg03E9d\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(5430,547,'_video','field_649f271ce6802'),(5431,547,'large_word_two','Playful'),(5432,547,'_large_word_two','field_649f2731e6804'),(5433,547,'large_word_three','Joyful'),(5434,547,'_large_word_three','field_649f2743e6805'),(5435,547,'about','<h2>Created by Upswing, the Homemade Circus toolkit will equip you with the skills and confidence to lead your own inspiring circus activity sessions.</h2>\r\nIn the decade that we have been bringing circus into care homes, we have seen some extraordinary results. Our activities have helped spark new friendships, brought shy residents out of their shell, seen dexterity and flexibility return, and helped care staff and residents to see each other in a whole new light.\r\n<h3>What\'s included:</h3>\r\nInside you’ll find instructional videos, activity worksheets, expert guidance and practical insights to take your sessions further.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re seeking gentle introductions or a challenge, our circus artists will guide you step-by-step on how to properly use different circus equipment and share the joy of circus with the people in your care home.\r\n\r\nEven a complete beginner can learn to structure their first unforgettable circus session that is tailored to the people they work with.\r\n\r\n<strong>If you\'re ready to try something new in your care home, click the \'join now\' button below.</strong>\r\n\r\n[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]'),(5436,547,'_about','field_649f272ce6803'),(5437,547,'pricing','<h2>Choose from 3 flexible membership options</h2>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">Everyone deserves access to valuable resources and support, regardless of their background or budget.</p>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">We offer 3 membership options on a sliding scale so that you can find an accessible option for you. No matter which membership you choose, you\'ll get the same content as everyone else.</p>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>(Our donation-based memberships help subsidise the free &amp; discounted options, ensuring accessible resources for all!)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">Whether you\'re an NHS worker, care home staff, individual, freelancer, or part of a larger organisation, click \'Join Now\' to choose your membership</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]</span></h2>'),(5438,547,'_pricing','field_649f277ae6806'),(5439,547,'testimonials','3'),(5440,547,'_testimonials','field_649f2791e6807'),(5441,547,'contact','To find out more about Homemade Circus or to contact for any other reason please email us at\r\n\r\n<a href=\"mailto:info@upswing.org.uk\">info@upswing.org.uk</a>'),(5442,547,'_contact','field_649f27c9e680a'),(5443,547,'final_image','193'),(5444,547,'_final_image','field_649f27d4e680b'),(5445,547,'about_opening_paragraph',''),(5446,547,'_about_opening_paragraph','field_649f28c8681cc'),(5447,547,'testimonials_0_testimonial','I used to think the circus was a clown with a big red nose, but it\'s not that. it\'s fun, it\'s\r\nexercise, it\'s music, it\'s singing together, it\'s bonding together. It\'s like holding hands, and\r\nforming a group dance. It\'s bringing all the people together and that\'s good for their\r\nwellbeing… They smile, they talk about this for the next few days and take the positive\r\nimpact with them…'),(5448,547,'_testimonials_0_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5449,547,'testimonials_0_name','Care Home Staff'),(5450,547,'_testimonials_0_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5451,547,'testimonials_1_testimonial','These activities are just so much fun. I always say to people - I can do a 12 hour shift on those days because it just takes me somewhere else…It gives you that excitement... you have so much extra oxygen! So, so much creativity.'),(5452,547,'_testimonials_1_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5453,547,'testimonials_1_name','Care Home Staff'),(5454,547,'_testimonials_1_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5455,547,'testimonials_2_testimonial','The first session was just magical. It really stuck in my head… I never thought that I could\r\ndo so many things with a ball or a hat or a simple scarf. It\'s like now when we get bored, you\r\ncan take anything and you can just dance around, make some fun things with it. I never\