,'field_649f277ae6806'),(5565,550,'testimonials','3'),(5566,550,'_testimonials','field_649f2791e6807'),(5567,550,'contact','To find out more about Homemade Circus or to contact for any other reason please email us at\r\n\r\n<a href=\"mailto:info@upswing.org.uk\">info@upswing.org.uk</a>'),(5568,550,'_contact','field_649f27c9e680a'),(5569,550,'final_image','193'),(5570,550,'_final_image','field_649f27d4e680b'),(5571,550,'about_opening_paragraph',''),(5572,550,'_about_opening_paragraph','field_649f28c8681cc'),(5573,550,'testimonials_0_testimonial','I used to think the circus was a clown with a big red nose, but it\'s not that. it\'s fun, it\'s\r\nexercise, it\'s music, it\'s singing together, it\'s bonding together. It\'s like holding hands, and\r\nforming a group dance. It\'s bringing all the people together and that\'s good for their\r\nwellbeing… They smile, they talk about this for the next few days and take the positive\r\nimpact with them…'),(5574,550,'_testimonials_0_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5575,550,'testimonials_0_name','Care Home Staff'),(5576,550,'_testimonials_0_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5577,550,'testimonials_1_testimonial','These activities are just so much fun. I always say to people - I can do a 12 hour shift on those days because it just takes me somewhere else…It gives you that excitement... you have so much extra oxygen! So, so much creativity.'),(5578,550,'_testimonials_1_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5579,550,'testimonials_1_name','Care Home Staff'),(5580,550,'_testimonials_1_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5581,550,'testimonials_2_testimonial','The first session was just magical. It really stuck in my head… I never thought that I could\r\ndo so many things with a ball or a hat or a simple scarf. It\'s like now when we get bored, you\r\ncan take anything and you can just dance around, make some fun things with it. I never\r\nthought I could create something out of nothing, really.'),(5582,550,'_testimonials_2_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5583,550,'testimonials_2_name','Care Home Staff'),(5584,550,'_testimonials_2_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5585,550,'temp_image','224'),(5586,550,'_temp_image','field_64c784060f370'),(5587,550,'large_word_one_caption','Whether you\'re a carer or an activity coordinator, make your care home come alive with joy, connection and endless possibilities...'),(5588,550,'_large_word_one_caption','field_6582eaead6654'),(5589,550,'large_word_two_caption','The Homemade Circus Digital Toolkit gives you complete confidence to lead circus activities in your care home environment.'),(5590,550,'_large_word_two_caption','field_6582eaf9d6655'),(5591,550,'large_word_three_caption','We\'ve spent 10+ years testing and evaluating these activities. Now we\'re sharing our tried-and-tested toolkit with you.'),(5592,550,'_large_word_three_caption','field_6582eb08d6656'),(5593,551,'large_word_one','Connection'),(5594,551,'_large_word_one','field_649f26a3e6800'),(5595,551,'slideshow','a:5:{i:0;s:3:\"187\";i:1;s:3:\"189\";i:2;s:3:\"193\";i:3;s:3:\"195\";i:4;s:3:\"191\";}'),(5596,551,'_slideshow','field_649f270ce6801'),(5597,551,'video','<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q65pOMSbvV8?si=e0i50hbJAgg03E9d\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(5598,551,'_video','field_649f271ce6802'),(5599,551,'large_word_two','Playful'),(5600,551,'_large_word_two','field_649f2731e6804'),(5601,551,'large_word_three','Joyful'),(5602,551,'_large_word_three','field_649f2743e6805'),(5603,551,'about','<h2>Created by Upswing, the Homemade Circus toolkit will equip you with the skills and confidence to lead your own inspiring circus activity sessions.</h2>\r\n<strong>In the decade that we have been bringing circus into care homes, we have seen some extraordinary results. Our activities have helped spark new friendship