ay to people - I can do a 12 hour shift on those days because it just takes me somewhere else…It gives you that excitement... you have so much extra oxygen! So, so much creativity.'),(5966,604,'_testimonials_1_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5967,604,'testimonials_1_name','Care Home Staff'),(5968,604,'_testimonials_1_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5969,604,'testimonials_2_testimonial','The first session was just magical. It really stuck in my head… I never thought that I could\r\ndo so many things with a ball or a hat or a simple scarf. It\'s like now when we get bored, you\r\ncan take anything and you can just dance around, make some fun things with it. I never\r\nthought I could create something out of nothing, really.'),(5970,604,'_testimonials_2_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(5971,604,'testimonials_2_name','Care Home Staff'),(5972,604,'_testimonials_2_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(5973,604,'temp_image','224'),(5974,604,'_temp_image','field_64c784060f370'),(5975,604,'large_word_one_caption','Whether you\'re a carer or an activity coordinator, make your care home come alive with joy, connection and endless possibilities...'),(5976,604,'_large_word_one_caption','field_6582eaead6654'),(5977,604,'large_word_two_caption','The Homemade Circus Digital Toolkit gives you complete confidence to lead circus activities in your care home environment.'),(5978,604,'_large_word_two_caption','field_6582eaf9d6655'),(5979,604,'large_word_three_caption','We\'ve spent 10+ years testing and evaluating these activities. Now we\'re sharing our tried-and-tested toolkit with you.'),(5980,604,'_large_word_three_caption','field_6582eb08d6656'),(5981,610,'large_word_one','Connection'),(5982,610,'_large_word_one','field_649f26a3e6800'),(5983,610,'slideshow','a:5:{i:0;s:3:\"187\";i:1;s:3:\"189\";i:2;s:3:\"193\";i:3;s:3:\"195\";i:4;s:3:\"191\";}'),(5984,610,'_slideshow','field_649f270ce6801'),(5985,610,'video','<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q65pOMSbvV8?si=e0i50hbJAgg03E9d\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(5986,610,'_video','field_649f271ce6802'),(5987,610,'large_word_two','Playful'),(5988,610,'_large_word_two','field_649f2731e6804'),(5989,610,'large_word_three','Joyful'),(5990,610,'_large_word_three','field_649f2743e6805'),(5991,610,'about','<h2>Created by Upswing, the Homemade Circus toolkit will equip you with the skills and confidence to lead your own inspiring circus activity sessions.</h2>\r\n<strong>In the decade that we have been bringing circus into care homes, we have seen some extraordinary results. </strong>Our activities have helped spark new friendships, brought shy residents out of their shell, seen dexterity and flexibility return, and helped care staff and residents to see each other in a whole new light.\r\n<h3>What\'s included:</h3>\r\nInside you’ll find instructional videos, activity worksheets, expert guidance and practical insights to take your sessions further.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re seeking gentle introductions or a challenge, our circus artists will guide you step-by-step on how to properly use different circus equipment and share the joy of circus with the people in your care home.\r\n\r\nEven a complete beginner can learn to structure their first unforgettable circus session that is tailored to the people they work with.\r\n\r\n<strong>If you\'re ready to try something new in your care home, click the \'join now\' button below.</strong>\r\n\r\n[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]<!-- notionvc: 0e9510f7-1aa4-4e54-a132-e4c1b4a23a77 -->'),(5992,610,'_about','field_649f272ce6803'),(5993,610,'pricing','<strong>Choose from 3 flexible membership options</strong>\r\n\r\nEveryone deserves access to valuable resources and support, regardless of their background or budget.\r\n\r\nWe offer 3 membership options on a sliding scale so that you can find an accessible option for you. No matter which membership you choose, you\'ll get the same content as everyone else.\r\n\r\n<strong>(Our donation-based memberships help subsidise the free &amp; discounted options, ensuring accessible resources for all!)</strong>\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re an NHS worker, care home staff, individual, freelancer, or part of a larger organisation, click \'Join Now\' to choose your membership\r\n<h2>[maxbutton id=\"1\" url=\"/plans/membership-options/\" text=\"Join Now\" ]</h2>\r\n<!-- notionvc: eebb0b45-36a7-4a97-9cc0-fd8424d9e050 -->'),(5994,610,'_pricing','field_649f277ae6806'),(5995,610,'testimonials','3'),(5996,610,'_testimonials','field_649f2791e6807'),(5997,610,'contact','To find out more about Homemade Circus or to contact for any other reason please email us at\r\n\r\n<a href=\"mailto:info@upswing.org.uk\">info@upswing.org.uk</a>'),(5998,610,'_contact','field_649f27c9e680a'),(5999,610,'final_image','193'),(6000,610,'_final_image','field_649f27d4e680b'),(6001,610,'about_opening_paragraph',''),(6002,610,'_about_opening_paragraph','field_649f28c8681cc'),(6003,610,'testimonials_0_testimonial','I used to think the circus was a clown with a big red nose, but it\'s not that. it\'s fun, it\'s\r\nexercise, it\'s music, it\'s singing together, it\'s bonding together. It\'s like holding hands, and\r\nforming a group dance. It\'s bringing all the people together and that\'s good for their\r\nwellbeing… They smile, they talk about this for the next few days and take the positive\r\nimpact with them…'),(6004,610,'_testimonials_0_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(6005,610,'testimonials_0_name','Care Home Staff'),(6006,610,'_testimonials_0_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(6007,610,'testimonials_1_testimonial','These activities are just so much fun. I always say to people - I can do a 12 hour shift on those days because it just takes me somewhere else…It gives you that excitement... you have so much extra oxygen! So, so much creativity.'),(6008,610,'_testimonials_1_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(6009,610,'testimonials_1_name','Care Home Staff'),(6010,610,'_testimonials_1_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(6011,610,'testimonials_2_testimonial','The first session was just magical. It really stuck in my head… I never thought that I could\r\ndo so many things with a ball or a hat or a simple scarf. It\'s like now when we get bored, you\r\ncan take anything and you can just dance around, make some fun things with it. I never\r\nthought I could create something out of nothing, really.'),(6012,610,'_testimonials_2_testimonial','field_649f27ace6808'),(6013,610,'testimonials_2_name','Care Home Staff'),(6014,610,'_testimonials_2_name','field_649f27b9e6809'),(6015,610,'temp_image','224'),(6016,610,'_temp_image','field_64c784060f370'),(6017,610,'large_word_one_caption','Whether you\'re a carer or an activity coordinator, make your care home come alive with joy, connection and endless possibilities...'),(6018,610,'_large_word_one_caption','field_6582eaead6654'),(6019,610,'large_word_two_caption','The Homemade Circus Digital Toolkit gives you complete confidence to lead circus activities in your care home environment.'),(6020,610,'_large_word_two_caption','field_6582eaf9d6655'),(6021,610,'large_word_three_caption','We\'ve spent 10+ years testing and evaluating these activities. Now we\'re sharing our tried-and-tested toolkit with you.'),(6022,610,'_large_word_three_caption','field_6582eb08d6656'),(6023,616,'_wp_attached_file','2023/07/Untitled-design-13.png'),(6024,616,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1920;s:6:\"height\";i:1080;s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"2023/07/Untitled-design-13.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:10391;s:5:\"sizes\";a:5:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"Untitled-design-13-300x169.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:101;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"Untitled-design-13-1024x576