e. If you\'re about to run your first session, print off what you need and take it with you, so that you can refer to it easily during the workshop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t forget that each activity page also includes an activity reminder/info sheet with bullet points to follow. If you\'d like a reminder during your first few sessions you can print these as well as take them with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"35px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:35px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":272,\"width\":\"384px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/health-and-safety/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-5.png\" alt=\"Health and Safety\" class=\"wp-image-272\" style=\"width:384px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/health-and-safety/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Health &amp; Safety</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":274,\"width\":\"368px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/before-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-6.png\" alt=\"Before your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-274\" style=\"width:368px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/before-your-workshop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Before Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"14px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:14px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":277,\"width\":\"389px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/during-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-9.png\" alt=\"During your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-277\" style=\"width:389px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/during-your-workshop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">During Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":293,\"width\":\"383px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/after-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-11.png\" alt=\"After your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-293\" style=\"width:383px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/after-your-workshop/\">After Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Planning Your Workshop','','inherit','closed','closed','','258-revision-v1','','','2024-05-20 20:31:22','2024-05-20 20:31:22','',258,'https://homemadecircus.yme.so/?p=568',0,'revision','',0),(569,3,'2024-05-20 20:32:10','2024-05-20 20:32:10','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As always, health and safety is an important consideration, especially when using new equipment. Some exercises involve touch and we always want to make sure everyone we’re working with feels completely comfortable with all parts of the activity. Follow these steps to make sure you have all the necessary Health and Safety in place before your session:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"11px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:11px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":449,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/asd-1024x521.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-449\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"24px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make sure you <strong>fill out a risk assessment form</strong> before your workshop. You can use our template which can be found in the \'Useful Links\' section on the right-hand side of this page.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Be sure that you have enough care home staff in the room at all times. <strong>Ideally you need 2-3 care home staff working alongside you</strong> to support you in delivering the session. Brief them on the activities, structure and Health and Safety considerations beforehand.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check that each participant or resident has <strong>enough space to stretch their arms and legs</strong> without clashing.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Leave space for people to exit and enter the workshop circle</strong> without disturbing the rest of the participants.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If using touch in your session, let the person know what you are planning to do and <strong>ask permission before you touch them</strong>. For example, when using a Flower Stick to massage each others\' hands and arms, you can say \'If you want, we can try using the sticks to gently massage your arms and hands, would you be okay with that?\'.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you’re assisting someone in moving a part of their body you can also <strong>check with them that it feels ok and nothing is painful</strong>.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure you <strong>always do a light warm-up and cool-down</strong> before and after every session so that no one gets hurt.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','Health and Safety','','inherit','closed','closed','','306-revision-v1','','','2024-05-20 20:32:10','2024-05-20 20:32:10','',306,'https://homemadecircus.yme.so/?p=569',0,'revision','',0),(570,3,'2024-05-20 20:32:22','2024-05-20 20:32:22','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As always, health and safety is an important consideration, especially when using new equipment. Some exercises involve touch and we always want to make sure everyone we’re working with feels completely comfortable with all parts of the activity. Follow these steps to make sure you have all the necessary Health and Safety in place before your session:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"21px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:21px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":449,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/asd-1024x521.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-449\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"24px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make sure you <strong>fill out a risk assessment form</strong> before your workshop. You can use our template which can be found in the \'Useful Links\' section on the right-hand side of this page.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Be sure that you have enough care home staff in the room at all times. <strong>Ideally you need 2-3 care home staff working alongside you</strong> to support you in delivering the session. Brief them on the activities, structure and Health and Safety considerations beforehand.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check that each participant or resident has <strong>enough space to stretch their arms and legs</strong> without clashing.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Leave space for people to exit and enter the workshop circle</strong> without disturbing the rest of the participants.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If using touch in your session, let the person know what you are planning to do and <strong>ask permission before you touch them</strong>. For example, when using a Flower Stick to massage each others\' hands and arms, you can say \'If you want, we can try using the sticks to gently massage your arms and hands, would you be okay with that?\'.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you’re assisting someone in moving a part of their body you can also <strong>check with them that it feels ok and nothing is painful</strong>.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure you <strong>always do a light warm-up and cool-down</strong> before and after every session so that no one gets hurt.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','Health and Safety','','inherit','closed','closed','','306-revision-v1','','','2024-05-20 20:32:22','2024-05-20 20:32:22','',306,'https://homemadecircus.yme.so/?p=570',0,'revision','',0),(571,3,'2024-05-20 20:35:56','2024-05-20 20:35:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We\'re so glad you\'re ready to start your circus adventure in care homes with us!  To begin, watch the short video below and our circus artist Charlene will explain how to navigate the toolkit and get the most out of it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each activity page includes everything you need to know, like details of where to get the equipment, how long the activity takes and who the activity is suited for. We suggest starting with the \'Coloured Scarves\' activity and working your way down. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/hkc5V3amLzg\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/hkc5V3amLzg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When you\'re ready, choose an activity from the left-hand menu to get started!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Had a go at the activities already? We would love to hear your thoughts - <a href=\"https://forms.gle/xUfnE8maKFeVGFDH8\">tell us what you thought here</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Welcome to the toolkit','','inherit','closed','closed','','42-revision-v1','','','2024-05-20 20:35:56','2024-05-20 20:35:56','',42,'https://homemadecircus.yme.so/?p=571',0,'revision','',0),(572,3,'2024-05-2