tube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/hkc5V3amLzg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When you\'re ready, choose an activity from the purple left-hand menu to get started</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Had a go at the activities already? We would love to hear about your experience! - <a href=\"https://forms.gle/xUfnE8maKFeVGFDH8\">tell us what you thought here</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Welcome to the toolkit','','inherit','closed','closed','','42-revision-v1','','','2024-05-20 20:36:53','2024-05-20 20:36:53','',42,'https://homemadecircus.yme.so/?p=574',0,'revision','',0),(576,3,'2024-05-20 20:37:08','2024-05-20 20:37:08','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We\'re so glad you\'re ready to start your circus adventure in care homes with us!  To begin, watch the short video below and our circus artist Charlene will explain how to navigate the toolkit and get the most out of it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each activity page includes everything you need to know, like details of where to get the equipment, how long the activity takes and who the activity is suited for. We suggest starting with the \'Coloured Scarves\' activity and working your way down. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/hkc5V3amLzg\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/hkc5V3amLzg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When you\'re ready, choose an activity from the purple left-hand menu to get started</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Had a go at some activities already? We would love to hear about your experience! - <a href=\"https://forms.gle/xUfnE8maKFeVGFDH8\">tell us what you thought here</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Welcome to the toolkit','','inherit','closed','closed','','42-revision-v1','','','2024-05-20 20:37:08','2024-05-20 20:37:08','',42,'https://homemadecircus.yme.so/?p=576',0,'revision','',0),(583,1,'2024-05-29 14:12:30','2024-05-29 14:12:30','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>If you\'ve watched all of the activity videos you might be wondering how to piece these together into your own workshop.</strong>..</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use the links below to take you through the steps of planning and preparing for your session. We\'ve included everything you should consider before your workshop, including template plans, workshop check lists, playlists and more. If you\'re about to run your first session, print off what you need and take it with you, so that you can refer to it easily during the workshop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t forget that each activity page also includes an activity reminder/info sheet with bullet points to follow. If you\'d like a reminder during your first few sessions you can print these as well as take them with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"35px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:35px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":272,\"width\":\"384px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/health-and-safety/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-5.png\" alt=\"Health and Safety\" class=\"wp-image-272\" style=\"width:384px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/health-and-safety/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Health &amp; Safety</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":274,\"width\":\"368px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/before-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-6.png\" alt=\"Before your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-274\" style=\"width:368px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/before-your-workshop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Before Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"14px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:14px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":277,\"width\":\"389px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/during-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-9.png\" alt=\"During your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-277\" style=\"width:389px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/during-your-workshop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">During Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":293,\"width\":\"383px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/after-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-11.png\" alt=\"After your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-293\" style=\"width:383px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/planning-your-workshop/after-your-workshop/\">After Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Planning Your Workshop','','inherit','closed','closed','','258-revision-v1','','','2024-05-29 14:12:30','2024-05-29 14:12:30','',258,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=583',0,'revision','',0),(584,1,'2024-05-29 14:33:04','2024-05-29 14:33:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>If you\'ve watched all of the activity videos you might be wondering how to piece these together into your own workshop.</strong>..</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use the links below to take you through the steps of planning and preparing for your session. We\'ve included everything you should consider before your workshop, including template plans, workshop check lists, playlists and more. If you\'re about to run your first session, print off what you need and take it with you, so that you can refer to it easily during the workshop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t forget that each activity page also includes an activity reminder/info sheet with bullet points to follow. If you\'d like a reminder during your first few sessions you can print these as well as take them with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"35px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:35px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":272,\"width\":\"384px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/health-and-safety/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-5.png\" alt=\"Health and Safety\" class=\"wp-image-272\" style=\"width:384px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"/planning-your-workshop/health-and-safety/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Health &amp; Safety</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":274,\"width\":\"368px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/before-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-6.png\" alt=\"Before your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-274\" style=\"width:368px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"/planning-your-workshop/before-your-workshop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Before Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"14px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:14px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":277,\"width\":\"389px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/during-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-9.png\" alt=\"During your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-277\" style=\"width:389px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"/planning-your-workshop/during-your-workshop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">During Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":293,\"width\":\"383px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"/after-your-workshop/\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/HEALTH-SAFETY-11.png\" alt=\"After your workshop\" class=\"wp-image-293\" style=\"width:383px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"/planning-your-workshop/after-your-workshop/\">After Your Workshop</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Planning Your Workshop','','inherit','closed','closed','','258-revision-v1','','','2024-05-29 14:33:04','2024-05-29 14:33:04','',258,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=584',0,'revision','',0),(600,3,'2026-01-13 17:55:08','2026-01-13 17:55:08','','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','24-revision-v1','','','2026-01-13 17:55:08','2026-01-13 17:55:08','',24,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=600',0,'revision','',0),(602,3,'2026-01-13 17:55:38','2026-01-13 17:55:38','','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','24-revision-v1','','','2026-01-13 17:55:38','2026-01-13 17:55:38','',24,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=602',0,'revision','',0),(604,3,'2026-01-13 17:56:29','2026-01-13 17:56:29','','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','24-revision-v1','','','2026-01-13 17:56:29','2026-01-13 17:56:29','',24,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=604',0,'revision','',0),(610,3,'2026-04-09 10:51:50','2026-04-09 10:51:50','','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','24-revision-v1','','','2026-04-09 10:51:50','2026-04-09 10:51:50','',24,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=610',0,'revision','',0),(611,3,'2026-04-09 10:53:00','2026-04-09 10:53:00','','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','24-revision-v1','','','2026-04-09 10:53:00','2026-04-09 10:53:00','',24,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=611',0,'revision','',0),(613,3,'2026-07-23 10:09:40','2026-07-23 10:09:40','{\"version\": 3, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-homemadecircus','','','2026-07-23 10:09:40','2026-07-23 10:09:40','',0,'http://homemade-circus.local/wp-global-styles-homemadecircus/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0),(616,3,'2026-08-06 12:04:49','2026-08-06 12:04:49','','Untitled design (13)','','inherit','open','closed','','untitled-design-13','','','2026-08-06 12:04:49','2026-08-06 12:04:49','',63,'http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Untitled-design-13.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(634,3,'2026-08-20 13:36:40','2026-08-20 13:36:40','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Between March - June 2026, Upswing\'s lead artists Brendan Patrick Rogers and Charlene Low spent three months working with people living with Parkinson\'s at University Hospitals of North Midlands, running Homemade Circus sessions in Stoke-on-Trent to learn directly from participants what worked, what didn\'t, and what needed rethinking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-62-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":637,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-10-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-637\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":638,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-81-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-638\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The goal was to let the sessions reshape the Homemade Circus Toolkit, so that it fits the specific ways Parkinson\'s can show up in a session, from freezing of gait to fatigue to facial masking, rather than treating those symptoms as an afterthought to activities built for a different group.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The PDF guide we created sets out how Parkinson\'s tends to show up in a circus session, symptom by symptom, and the specific adjustments we made. If you\'re planning to run a session with a group who has Parkinson\'s, or already do and want to sharpen how you approach it, this is where to start.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>See the \'Useful Links\' menu on the left for the <em>Circus and Parkinson\'s Guide for Facilitators</em>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Working with Parkinson\'s','','publish','closed','closed','','working-with-parkinsons','','','2026-08-20 14:04:26','2026-08-20 14:04:26','',0,'http://homemade-circus.local/?page_id=634',0,'page','',0),(635,3,'2026-08-20 12:43:28','2026-08-20 12:43:28','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is nice to round-off the activities after you are finished so that everyone is left feeling content and the connected feeling continues. It is also a great time to take notes for yourself of what did and didn\'t work, so that you can focus on those in the next session. Here are some ideas of ways to close the session that will leave participants excited for the next one, choose what feels right for the room:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Closing the session:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":462,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://homemadecircus.yme.so/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/20240206-SA901584-1024x486.jpg\" alt=\"a circus workshop leader shakes hands with an older workshop participant\" class=\"wp-image-462\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"25px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cooldown</strong> and light movement/stretching</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If the atmosphere seems lively, you can keep the music playing and <strong>use this as socialising time</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Serving tea &amp; cake</strong> whilst everyone’s together</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Remind people when the next session is</strong> while they’re in the room</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you’re keeping <strong>records of people’s attendance and any surprising interactions you noticed</strong>, straight after the workshop is a great time to write these down because you will be able to remember the little details more clearly, and you can also reflect on how the session went and what could be improved for next time</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We’d love to hear about your experience so <strong>it’s also the perfect time to send us any feedback</strong>. The project has been a collaborative process and we would love that to continue. We welcome feedback or thoughts about the Digital toolkit, its content or how your sessions are going - <a href=\"https://forms.gle/xUfnE8maKFeVGFDH8\">Please fill in our short feedback form</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','Adapting sessions','','inherit','closed','closed','','317-autosave-v1','','','2026-08-20 12:43:28','2026-08-20 12:43:28','',317,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=635',0,'revision','',0),(636,3,'2026-08-20 13:12:49','2026-08-20 13:12:49','','HMC ParkinsonsUK Full Res (By Jerome Whittingham) 13.05 (62)','','inherit','open','closed','','hmc-parkinsonsuk-full-res-by-jerome-whittingham-13-05-62','','','2026-08-20 13:12:49','2026-08-20 13:12:49','',634,'http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-62.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(637,3,'2026-08-20 13:13:07','2026-08-20 13:13:07','','HMC ParkinsonsUK Full Res (By Jerome Whittingham) 13.05 (10)','','inherit','open','closed','','hmc-parkinsonsuk-full-res-by-jerome-whittingham-13-05-10','','','2026-08-20 13:13:07','2026-08-20 13:13:07','',634,'http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-10.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(638,3,'2026-08-20 13:13:22','2026-08-20 13:13:22','','HMC ParkinsonsUK Full Res (By Jerome Whittingham) 13.05 (81)','','inherit','open','closed','','hmc-parkinsonsuk-full-res-by-jerome-whittingham-13-05-81','','','2026-08-20 13:13:22','2026-08-20 13:13:22','',634,'http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-81.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(639,3,'2026-08-20 13:28:52','2026-08-20 13:28:52','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Between March - June 2026, Upswing\'s lead artists Brendan Patrick Rogers and Charlene Low spent three months working with people living with Parkinson\'s at University Hospitals of North Midlands, running Homemade Circus sessions in Stoke-on-Trent to learn directly from participants what worked, what didn\'t, and what needed rethinking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-62-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":637,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-10-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-637\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":638,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-81-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-638\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The goal was to let the sessions reshape the Homemade Circus Toolkit, so that it fits the specific ways Parkinson\'s can show up in a session, from freezing of gait to fatigue to facial masking, rather than treating those symptoms as an afterthought to activities built for a different group.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The PDF guide we created sets out how Parkinson\'s tends to show up in a circus session, symptom by symptom, and the specific adjustments we made. If you\'re planning to run a session with a group who has Parkinson\'s, or already do and want to sharpen how you approach it, this is where to start.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Working with Parkinson\'s','','inherit','closed','closed','','634-revision-v1','','','2026-08-20 13:28:52','2026-08-20 13:28:52','',634,'http://homemade-circus.local/?p=639',0,'revision','',0),(640,3,'2026-08-20 13:36:40','2026-08-20 13:36:40','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Between March - June 2026, Upswing\'s lead artists Brendan Patrick Rogers and Charlene Low spent three months working with people living with Parkinson\'s at University Hospitals of North Midlands, running Homemade Circus sessions in Stoke-on-Trent to learn directly from participants what worked, what didn\'t, and what needed rethinking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-62-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":637,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-10-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-637\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":638,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://homemade-circus.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HMC-ParkinsonsUK-Full-Res-By-Jerome-Whittingham-13.05-81-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-638\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The goal was to let the sessions reshape the Homemade Circus Toolkit, so that it fits the specific ways Parkinson\'s can show up in a session, from freezing of gait to fatigue to facial masking, rather than treating those symptoms as an afterthought to activities built for a different group.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The PDF guide we created sets out how Parkinson\'s tends to show up in a circus session, symptom by symptom, and the specific adjustments we made. If you\'re planning to run a session with a group who has Parkinson\'s, or already do and want to sharpen how you approach it, this is where to start.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>See the \'Useful Links\' menu on the left for the \'<em>Circus and Parkinson\'s Guide for Facilitators\'</em>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Working with Parkinson\'s','','inherit','closed','closed','','634-revision-v1',